'''Two-Down''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill the [[Pestilent Bloat]] before he shuts down a third time.

==Strategy==
This achievement is very easy to accomplish as long as players are using the best strength gear they can afford, or elite void. Ideally some players should have the [[Scythe of Vitur]], though players should have at least a [[crystal halberd]], [[dragon claws]], and a [[salve amulet (e)]] since the Bloat is susceptible to the amulet's effects.

